  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.0-beta.1\n- updates code for [incremental generator](https://github.com/dotnet/roslyn/blob/main/docs/features/incremental-generators.md)\n- refactors code\n- uses GodotTscnParser 1.0.0-beta.5\nv.1.0.0-beta.2\n- adds support for editable [parser]\nv.1.0.0-beta.1\n- promotes alpha.11 to beta\nv.1.0.0-alpha.11\n- renames version to adhere to semantic versioning\nv.1.0.0-alpha11\n- fixes strong typed resources missing using statement\nv.1.0.0-alpha10\n- fixes strong typed resources path concatenation\nv.1.0.0-alpha9\n- improves strong typed resources generator\nv.1.0.0-alpha8\n- generates strong typed path to scenes resources\nv.1.0.0-alpha7\n- fixes class name when .tscn name is not pascal cased\nv.1.0.0-alpha6\n- rewrite node generator to support nesting\n- sample updated\nv.1.0.0-alpha5\n- adds support for nested nodes\nv.1.0.0-alpha4\n- updates nodes and scripts parsing\n- updates godot project parsing\n- adds groups to nodes\nv.1.0.0-alpha3\n- adds input actions constants based on project.godot file parsing\nv.1.0.0-alpha2\n- adds strong typed animation names\nv.1.0.0-alpha1\n- initial version\n- creates strong typed GetNode calls",
